OL,5,G1600 Sound of Cinema
OL,6,     FEdith Bowman presents a haunting
OL,7,     Fselection of the best film scores
OL,8,     Fand soundtracks. Featuring a
OL,9,     Fspecial interview with composer
OL,10,     FAnna Meredith about her score to
OL,11,     F'Wicker'.
OL,12,G1700 This Classical Life
OL,13,     FJess Gillam is joined by the
OL,14,     Fpianist Cordelia Williams for a
OL,15,     Flistening party, including music
OL,16,     Fby Prokofiev, Bach and Joni
OL,17,     FMitchell.
